					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180502,
					"content": "可以睜開眼睛了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761180503,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180504,
					"content": "（她真的睜眼了！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180505,
					"content": "（平常講太順口了…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761180506,
					"content": "好美。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180507,
					"content": "這對翅膀，讓它顯得更完整了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180508,
					"content": "這是我等「霜月之子」送給哥倫比婭妳的禮物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180509,
					"content": "慶祝我們的神明從此能夠自由翱翔，她的指尖終於觸碰到了「家」的所在。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180510,
					"content": "…從前的我看到這神像，只會浮現出自己出生時迷茫的心情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180511,
					"content": "現在，我感受到的則是「家」的溫暖。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180512,
					"content": "或許就像這尊雕像，儘管已經擁有了翅膀，但我依舊選擇於此處棲身。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180513,
					"content": "謝謝你們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180514,
					"content": "除此之外，還有一份禮物，不過需要跟著我多走一段路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180515,
					"content": "欸？還有驚喜嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180516,
					"content": "我和同胞們在林中籌辦了一場簡單的歡迎宴會。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180517,
					"content": "哥倫比婭，從今往後，這裡也將成為妳的家園。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180518,
					"content": "當妳想家的時候，就請妳安心留下來，多喝幾杯粗茶吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180519,
					"content": "好啊，我會的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180520,
					"content": "正好，月亮升起來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180521
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761180521,
					"content": "我們走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180522,
					"content": "希望每一個夜晚，都同那日的祈月之夜一樣美好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180523,
					"content": "歡迎回家，哥倫比婭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				}
			]
